D2  IS beta_t BLUR OR CONTENT?  (correlate with camera velocity from COLMAP)

 bonsai: n=248  beta_t med 0.01377  p95/p5 6.17x
   corr(beta_t, translational speed) r=+0.132  spearman +0.232
   corr(beta_t, angular speed)       r=-0.114  spearman -0.046
   READ: strongly NEGATIVE r => faster camera -> less HF -> beta_t IS motion blur.
         near-zero r        => beta_t is CONTENT, group 4 ungated.

 chair: n=205  beta_t med 0.03775  p95/p5 7.09x
   corr(beta_t, translational speed) r=-0.001  spearman +0.031
   corr(beta_t, angular speed)       r=-0.061  spearman -0.058
   READ: strongly NEGATIVE r => faster camera -> less HF -> beta_t IS motion blur.
         near-zero r        => beta_t is CONTENT, group 4 ungated.

